TEST T33354 -- (191) Authentication&Security_IEEE 802.1X - EAP-Notification
================================================================================
Run:      2026-10-23 15:02-15:07 NZDT.  A RADIUS server on the testbox sent an
          EAP-Request/Notification, and the frames on the supplicant's wire were read
          to see whether the DUT passed it on.
Bench:    tb277, consoles u2 (swi_d); Test Engineer bidhanc@bidhanc-dl
Tester:   bench-runner
Graded:   tester
Case:     AWPTCM-T33354, objective "Not Support", no steps authored.  The three legs
          below were designed for this bench.  A notification is created by the
          authentication server, not by the switch, so no switch setting can make one
          appear.  The only way to test the switch is to be the server and send one.
