     0.009 02:0d:b9:00:33:54 <- EAP-Request/Identity id=1 len=0 raw=
     0.014 02:0d:b9:00:33:54 -> EAP-Response/Identity "cknotify"
     0.018 02:0d:b9:00:33:54 <- EAP-Request/MD5-Challenge id=2 len=17 raw=10864ac16ef728f6213907c58526c7579a
     0.021 02:0d:b9:00:33:54 -> EAP-Response/MD5-Challenge digest=fc7c828625a02fb89ae766a0e209507d
     1.026 02:0d:b9:00:33:54 <- EAP-Success id=2
