ALSO MEASURED -- the host mode silently weakens `dot1x control-direction`
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  `dot1x control-direction both` was in force when leg C started.  After setting
  `auth host-mode multi-supplicant` for that leg:

awplus# show running-config interface port1.0.48
 dot1x port-control auto
 dot1x control-direction in            <-- nobody typed this
 auth host-mode multi-supplicant

  No warning, no "% " line, no log entry.  `both` was sent again by hand and read back
  to confirm it.
